# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into each new worktree it creates
# (.gitignore syntax; only paths that are also gitignored get copied).
#
# The licensed art and audio under assets/ can't be committed (see
# assets/README.md), so without this a fresh worktree has only the README and
# the game panics on launch. Same pattern as .gitignore, so exactly the
# ignored files match and the tracked README is left alone.
assets/*
